bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Style Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control StylesController
control AccessTokenGuard
control RolesGuard
control StylesService
entity ":StylesModel" as StylesModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Open "Add Style" dialog + submit form
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> UI: 2. Client validate (name, description)
activate UI
space
deactivate UI

opt Client validation failed
    UI --> Admin: 2.1. Show inline error
end
    UI -> Router: 3. POST /styles
    activate Router

Router -> AccessTokenGuard: 4. canActivate(request)
activate AccessTokenGuard

AccessTokenGuard -> AccessTokenGuard: 5. Client validate (name, description)
activate AccessTokenGuard
space
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

opt Token invalid
    AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 5.1. Deny
    Router --> UI: 5.2. 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 5.3. Show error message
end
AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 6. Allow
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

Router -> RolesGuard: 7. checkRole(ADMIN)
activate RolesGuard

opt Role invalid
    RolesGuard --> Router: 7.1. Deny
    Router --> UI: 7.2. 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 7.3. Show error message
end
RolesGuard --> Router: 8. Allow
deactivate RolesGuard

Router -> StylesController: 9. create(dto)
activate StylesController

StylesController -> StylesService: 10. create(body)
activate StylesService

StylesService -> StylesModel: 11. create(style)
activate StylesModel
StylesModel -> MongoDB: 12. insert document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> StylesModel: 13. Saved document
deactivate MongoDB
StylesModel --> StylesService: 14. Created style
deactivate StylesModel

StylesService -> StylesService: 15. Check duplicate
activate StylesService
space
deactivate StylesService

opt Duplicate name or DB error
    StylesService --> StylesController: 15.1. Throw error
    StylesController --> Router: 15.2. HTTP 400/500
    Router --> UI: 15.3. Create failed
    UI --> Admin: 15.4. Show error message
end

StylesService --> StylesController: 16. Created style
deactivate StylesService
StylesController --> Router: 17. HTTP 201 response
deactivate StylesController
Router --> UI: 18. Return created style
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 19. Create style success
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin